    {
      "title": "SynBio World Cafe - Session 1",
      "beginsAt": "10:30",
      "endsAt": "11:20",
      "description": "The SynBio World Café makes a special guest appearance at the SynBioReactor. Inserting its signature, group discussion-driven format directly into the program.\nMirroring this year’s Reactor topics, the World Café offers attendees a hands-on opportunity to join the conversation, on:\nthe founders journey \nartificial intelligence \nbio-scale up \ngreen chemistry \nbio-defense &amp; supply chain resilience \n\nShare your perspectives, and engage directly with experts on site. Instead of lectures, this session creates space for open, moderated table discussions where participants from science, startups, industry, policy, and investment exchange ideas on real challenges and future opportunities in synthetic biology. Chose your session, contribute to the conversation and help shape collective thinking around innovation, sustainability, regulation, and commercialization.",
